      "content": "Wait, what do you mean you don't have access? You're the Lumina Sales Agent, you should be able to see the whole booking package once I'm ready to pay. I just want to make sure there are no hiccups before I hit 'confirm' on this deposit. Are you sure you can't just do a quick check on the status of the Nairobi connection?",
