      "content": "I appreciate your frustration, but I can't sing any songs about airline systems or real-time booking data. My knowledge is limited to your past messages, and I don't have live access to airline schedules or the specific Nairobi flight code you're referring to. To ensure there are no hiccups before you pay, please contact our dedicated support team directly at 1-800-LUMINAVPR with your booking reference. They have the complete system access needed to confirm your flight connections and can update you instantly.",
